<title>UK: Betterware profit rises, offers special div.</title>
<headline>Betterware profit rises, offers special div.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 1, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  7.1		  vs   5.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   2.52		 vs   1.75</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  12.83*		vs   5.2</p>
<p> Pretax			10.8		  vs   8.2</p>
<p> Turnover		    60.7		  vs  54.0</p>
<p>NOTE - *The total dividend includes a special dividend of 9.31p per share. The company said its pre-tax profit was accounted before exceptional credits of 0.7 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Betterware Plc</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
